New positive/negative controls:
- a valid exactly-3-of-4 nonce-bound proof is independently accepted;
- an invalid anchor commit signature is rejected even when the anchor read response is re-signed;
- fewer than 3 initialization markers is rejected.

Independent verifier requires an out-of-band pinned roster, expected identity/key/policy and caller-held nonce. It does not establish administrator independence, external durable custody, trusted time, hardware monotonicity, or production readiness. Original two joint-rollback RED controls remain. RESEARCH_ONLY / HOLD / NO_REAL_KEYS / NO_TRUST_ACTIVATION / NO_PRODUCTION.
